 "Tell us what would make the archive easier or more useful. This form is about the archive itself.": "请告诉我们怎样能让档案更好用、更有帮助。此表单仅用于收集对档案本身的意见。",
 "Remembering the Waters is Kenya’s first national archive dedicated to maritime and inland-water safety heritage. It documents past ferry and boat disasters, everyday safety experiences and community knowledge from the coast, the lakes and the rivers, so that lives lost and lessons learned are not forgotten.": "Remembering the Waters 是肯尼亚第一个专门记录海洋与内陆水域安全遗产的国家级档案。它记录过去的渡轮和船只事故、日常的安全经历，以及来自沿海、湖泊与河流地区的社区知识，让逝去的生命和得到的教训不被遗忘。",
 "What this platform is for": "本平台的用途",
 "People who live and work near Kenya’s waters share their stories, testimonies, photographs and recordings here. Researchers, students, safety agencies, policymakers and the public can read, listen to, search and cite them, free of charge and without an account.": "在肯尼亚水域附近生活和工作的人们在这里分享他们的故事、证词、照片和录音。研究人员、学生、安全机构、政策制定者和公众都可以免费阅读、收听、搜索和引用这些内容，无需注册账号。",
